e process exit code. This failure path was not runtime-reproduced; verify expected counts and raw execution evidence before accepting a pass. LSP diagnostics need the editor; screenshots launch a separate Godot process and need a display. It is a feedback layer, not broad scene authoring.","limitations","What the source actually contains","Reviewed MCP test registration, Godot process launch and GUT/GdUnit4 output parsers; also reviewed heuristic script analysis and an LSP client that obtains editor diagnostics. Scene analysis, project launching and screenshots have separate modules.","codeScope","Code type","Implementation","codeType","links","Evidence","items",[79],"evidenceUrl",{"_50":75,"_25":80},"https://github.com/gregario/godot-forge/blob/401f41494eb0777c1e5c848e0e7cce5cafd9cc25/src/tools/script-analysis.ts","Code / instructions",[84],"codeUrl",{"_50":81,"_25":85},"https://github.com/gregario/godot-forge/blob/401f41494eb0777c1e5c848e0e7cce5cafd9cc25/src/tools/test-runner.ts","Primary source",[89],"sourceUrl",{"_50":86,"_25":90},"https://github.com/gregario/godot-forge","Engine / runtime","Godot 4 / GDScript","engine","list","Attributed clients / models","ordered",false,[100,101,102,103],"agents","Claude Code","Codex","Gemini CLI","Cursor","Toolkit category","Engine bridges","lead","summary","bridge",[111,112,113,114],"implementation","claude-code","codex","gemini-cli","cursor",{"_116":117},"documents",{"_118":119,"_120":121},"en",[123,127,128,129,126,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,125,162,124,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180],"zh",[122,123,124,125,126],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-